            <div style="padding:0 22px 20px;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;">

                <p style="margin:14px 0;color:#94a3b8;">Each country website ships transactional mail (orders, OTP, contact-us notifications, lead auto-replies) through its own SMTP relay. The flow below assumes you use Google Workspace per country — adapt to your provider as needed.</p>

                <div style="background:#1e293b;border-left:3px solid #60a5fa;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:4px;margin:0 0 16px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;">
                    <span style="color:#60a5fa;flex-shrink:0;display:inline-flex;margin-top:2px;"><?php echo $_icon('bulb', 14) ?></span>
