                        <strong style="color:#60a5fa;">Quick recap:</strong>
                        Get an <strong>App Password</strong> from the country's mailbox → click <strong>Gmail / Workspace</strong> on the card → paste username + App Password → <strong>Save</strong> → <strong>Send Test</strong>.
                    </span>
